# Example-runner documents and archived doc versions additionally need 'unsafe-eval'
# (SystemJS eval-loads modules; the Angular JIT compiler and the duckdb-wasm data
# engine also compile/instantiate in the browser). <If> sections merge after all
# other configuration, so this unset+set replaces the header set above for matching
# requests.
<If "%{REQUEST_URI} =~ m#/(examples|archive)/#">
    Header always unset Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only
    Header always set Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' blob: https://*.ag-grid.com https://plausible.io https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://esm.sh https://bryntum.com https://js.zi-scripts.com https://*.zoominfo.com https://www.google.com https://www.gstatic.com https://www.youtube.com https://cdn.cookielaw.org 'wasm-unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://bryntum.com https://use.fontawesome.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com https://bryntum.com https://use.fontawesome.com data:; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; connect-src 'self' https://*.ag-grid.com https://plausible.io https://*.algolia.net https://*.algolianet.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://stats.g.doubleclick.net https://www.googletagmanager.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://esm.sh https://play.clickhouse.com https://api.worldbank.org https://api.open-meteo.com https://earthquake.usgs.gov https://api.beta.ons.gov.uk https://js.zi-scripts.com https://*.zoominfo.com https://www.google.com https://cdn.cookielaw.org https://*.onetrust.com https://us-central1-aggrid-ecommerce.cloudfunctions.net; frame-src 'self' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google.com https://www.youtube.com; media-src 'self' data: blob: https:; worker-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://us-central1-aggrid-ecommerce.cloudfunctions.net https://webto.salesforce.com https://codesandbox.io https://plnkr.co; frame-ancestors 'self' https://*.ag-grid.com"
